        {{ loadingMore ? 'Loading…' : 'Load more' }}
      </button>
    </div>
  </PageShell>
</template>
```

Should "error code" show '—' when null? The plan says "error code run_error_code displayed alongside run_status". When null, showing — is more uniform. `run.run_error_code ?? '—'`.

